{
  "slug": "accelerate",
  "name": "Accelerate",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Insights, experimentation and personalization for WordPress. Self-learning loops to automatically iterate on content.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **1 agent**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `accelerate` (Any question about a WordPress site — analytics, traffic, bounce rate, conversions, A/B tests, landing pages, audiences, personalization,…), `accelerate-abilities-reference` (What can this toolkit do), `accelerate-campaigns` (Which campaign is working), `accelerate-connect` (Connect the toolkit to your WordPress site), `accelerate-content-plan` (What should I write next), `accelerate-design` (Design a new on-brand version of a block or a fresh section — \"make me a variant of…), `accelerate-diagnose` (Why is this underperforming), `accelerate-evolve` (Improve a block over multiple rounds — \"keep improving my hero\", \"run an optimization loop on the homepage\",…), and 8 more\n- **Agents** (1): `accelerate-analyst` (Specialised data analyst for deep-dive investigations on an Accelerate WordPress site)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `wordpress`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install accelerate@claude-community` from `humanmade/accelerate-ai-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
